VRec shell recording helper
===========================

This directory contains code from the following Apache-2.0 projects, as
modified by VRec. The full Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE-scrcpy (it
is identical for both projects).

JemRec
  https://github.com/jemcik/JemRec
  Author: Yevhen Yemchynskyi
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Used: the shell-side capture daemon (Main, Voip, CallStates, Checks,
  AnswerMachine, AnswerSettings, Forwarding, Greeting, GreetingPlayer,
  LevelTap), originally in package com.jemcik.jemrec.shell; moved to
  com.vrec.app.shell and modified by VRec.

scrcpy
  https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy
  Copyright (C) 2018 Genymobile
  Copyright (C) 2018-2026 Romain Vimont
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Used: audio-only server runtime from v4.1, under com.genymobile.scrcpy,
  as embedded by JemRec. See PATCHES.md for every change.

VRec additions (not from either project) include PcmChannelHealth,
AnsweredCallGate, SimAudioCapture, VoipMicHealth, PcmRing and
CaptureHealthFile, plus VRec's recovery and diagnostic changes in the files
above.
